# No Build Rule

**NEVER** invoke a build, compile, make, or flash command. This includes but is not limited to:

- `make`, `cmake`, `ninja`
- `arm-none-eabi-gcc` or any GCC invocation
- STM32CubeIDE headless build commands
- Any `Debug/` or `Release/` build-system targets
- `st-flash`, `openocd`, `STM32_Programmer_CLI`, or any programming/flashing tool

When a build is needed (e.g. to verify compilation after code changes), **tell the user** so they can build manually in STM32CubeIDE. Do not attempt to build on their behalf.
